### Elasticsearch Version

elasticsearch8.11

### Installed Plugins

_No response_

### Java Version

_bundled_

### OS Version

centos7

### Problem Description

When all test documents are in the same segment, using script fields to get the second value of an array in a document,
the previous doc has a field named domain_id with value [1, 8], the next doc has the field which has the value [1]
when use
```
"script_fields": {
	"val": {
		"script": {
			"source": "doc.domain_id.values[1]",
			"lang": "painless"
		}
	}
}
```
to get domain_id's second value, the result is 8,8, but 8,0 is right.

### Steps to Reproduce

1、create an index as follows
```
PUT localhost:9200/test
{
	"settings": {
		"refresh_interval": "120s",#ensure all documents is written to the same segment "number_of_shards": 1,
		"number_of_replicas": 0
	},
	"mappings": {
		"arrays": {
			"dynamic": false,
			"properties": {
				"domain_id": {
					"type": "integer"
				}
			}
		}
	}
}

```
2、write some data
```
PUT localhost:9200/_bulk
{ "index" : { "_index" : "test", "_type": "arrays", "_id": 1}}
{"domain_id":[1]}
{ "index" : { "_index" : "test", "_type": "arrays", "_id": 2}}
{"domain_id":[1]}
{ "index" : { "_index" : "test", "_type": "arrays", "_id": 3}}
{"domain_id":[2]}
{ "index" : { "_index" : "test", "_type": "arrays", "_id": 4}}
{"domain_id":[3]}
{ "index" : { "_index" : "test", "_type": "arrays", "_id": 5}}
{"domain_id":[1]}
{ "index" : { "_index" : "test", "_type": "arrays", "_id": 6}}
{"domain_id":[1]}
{ "index" : { "_index" : "test", "_type": "arrays", "_id": 7}}
{"domain_id":[1,8]}
{ "index" : { "_index" : "test", "_type": "arrays", "_id": 8}}
{"domain_id":[1]}
{ "index" : { "_index" : "test", "_type": "arrays", "_id": 9}}
{"domain_id":[1]}
```

3、execute the query
```
GET localhost:9200/test/_search
{
	"_source": "domain_id",
	"script_fields": {
		"val": {
			"script": {
				"source": "doc.domain_id[1]",
				"lang": "painless"
			}
		}
	}
}
```

4、the result is wrong
```
{
	"took": 105,
	{
		"_index": "test3",
		"_type": "arrays",
		"_id": "6",
		"_score": 1.0,
		"_source": {
			"domain_id": [
				1
			]
		},
		"fields": {
			"val": [
				0
			]
		}
	},
	{
		"_index": "test3",
		"_type": "arrays",
		"_id": "7",
		"_score": 1.0,
		"_source": {
			"domain_id": [
				1,
				8
			]
		},
		"fields": {
			"val": [
				8
			]
		}
	},
	{
		"_index": "test3",
		"_type": "arrays",
		"_id": "8",
		"_score": 1.0,
		"_source": {
			"domain_id": [
				1
			]
		},
		"fields": {
			"val": [
				8
			]
		}
	}
}
```
.....
the result in the last hit should be 0,but 8,we think it uses the previous hit result.
